			"widgets_values":[
				"生成9宫格，每个宫格画面如下\n云海天阶（超广角·大远景·留白）\nPrompt: Epic cinematic extreme wide shot, massive sea of clouds rolling around colossal distant dark mountain peaks. A single towering celestial stairway made of translucent crystalline metamaterials slicing vertically into the upper stratosphere. Immense negative space, misty atmosphere, subtle golden sunrise rim light, grand sci-fi scale, 8k, photorealistic, Denis Villeneuve aesthetic.\n\n传髓授光（低机位·中景）\nPrompt: Cinematic low-angle medium shot. An ancient silicate humanoid elder with translucent skin kneeling on a frozen crystalline mountain ledge, extracting a glowing amber quantum core from his opened chest, passing it to a young kneeling successor. Cold blue blizzard mist, contrasting with the intense warm golden glow of the core, hyper-detailed skin textures, emotional.\n\n绝壁风雪（长焦压缩）\nPrompt: Telephoto compressed shot of a lone crystalline traveler in tattered dark thermal poncho struggling up a sheer vertical frozen precipice. Giant sheer rock faces fading into thick volumetric fog, dramatic verticality, tiny human figure conveying utter insignificance, cold atmospheric realism.\n\n命核粉碎（动态特写·留白）\nPrompt: Minimalist wide shot with dynamic focus, a shadowy humanoid figure falling through a sea of white mist. In mid-air, the glowing golden gemstone in its chest violently shatters into thousands of glowing golden embers and dust, high-speed shutter effect, tragic silent emptiness, cinematic depth of field.\n\n重置黑泥渊（低机位·微距）\nPrompt: Dark sci-fi subterranean ocean floor, deep black viscous tar-like sludge with countless microscopic pale luminescent larvae swimming through glowing crystal dust. Low-angle atmospheric lighting, eerie bio-luminescence, mysterious underworld abyss, volumetric smoke.\n\n云上天城与天河瀑布（超广角·大远景）\nPrompt: Breathtaking panoramic ultra-wide shot of a gargantuan ring-shaped sci-fi megacity suspended high above a sprawling ocean of clouds. Massive industrial waterfalls of purified coolant cascading off the city's metallic edge, disappearing into the white fog below. Distant mountain peaks in the background, breathtaking scale, pristine utopian architecture.\n\n光缆金树（中心对称·仰拍）\nPrompt: Monumental symmetrical low-angle shot looking up at a colossal central energy spire designed like a majestic sacred golden tree, braided from billions of luminous golden-amber fiber-optic conduits, towering into the upper atmosphere. Golden optical particles drifting down like glowing leaves, surrounded by floating white chrome pavilions in thick clouds.\n\n静默温室矩阵（极简·留白）\nPrompt: Vast minimalist architectural platform above the clouds, covered in a thin layer of drifting mist. Hundreds of translucent crystalline people sitting silently in perfect grid alignment, suspended in peaceful sleep. Cold ambient morning light, immense negative space, absolute stillness, eerie serenity.\n\n插管吮吸特写（特写·情绪冲击）\nPrompt: Disturbing high-detail close-up of a meditating alien being's pale neck, a thick translucent golden tube with cybernetic needle-clamps surgically embedded into the spine. Vivid neon-blue spiritual energy pulsing through the tube being sucked away, while the subject wears an ecstatic, empty smile, chiaroscuro lighting, cinematic realism.",
