tire subterranean cavern. The figure has cold calculating eyes looking down at tiny figures, neon blue scan-lines, and an overpowering authoritarian aura with cinematic grandeur. In the bottom-left panel, Thorne jams heavy high-voltage hydraulic shears into a central server junction. Violent blue lightning arcs rip his hazard gear, and explosive sparks illuminate the dark industrial interior in a dynamic action shot of heroic desperation. In the bottom-middle panel, a montage style shot shows multiple pod faces simultaneously gasping in pure agonizing consciousness as artificial smiles shatter and real tears break through cybernetic"
